/**
 * Catalog of every real PNG under public/assets/statling/eggs — generated from a
 * one-off filesystem + PNG-header probe, never guessed.
 *
 * Two unrelated sets live under eggs/:
 * - EGG_HATCH_SEQUENCE: the 7 growth-stage frames (0-6) actually driving
 *   components/brain-bet/egg-image.tsx today, one shared animated egg's life stages.
 * - EGG_DESIGNS: 480 standalone single-image egg designs (not animation frames of
 *   one egg — each is its own design), currently unused by any screen. Kept flat
 *   (eggs/designs/egg-NNN.png) rather than one directory per design, since there is
 *   no per-design animation state today — see docs/asset-migration-map.md.
 */

